  "title": "Meet Erin Dyer, 2020 TWIG Senior-Level Executive Recipient",
  "summary": "Each year, Progressive Grocer Magazine recognizes women in the grocery industry with the Top Women in Grocery awards. This year, Kroger was honored to have 49 associates recognized across three categories: Senior-level Executives, Rising Stars and Store Managers. One of the Senior-level Executives recognized is Erin Dyer, vice president of Operations for the Columbus Division. Erin […]",
